{
  "id": "JAS.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "JAS",
  "reference": "James 2",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JAS 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My brethren, hold not the faith of our Lord Jesus Christ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of glory, with respect of persons. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For if there come into your synagogue a man with a gold ring, in fine clothing, and there come in also a poor man in vile clothing; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and ye have regard to him that weareth the fine clothing, and say, Sit thou here in a good place; and ye say to the poor man, Stand thou there, or sit under my footstool; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "do ye not make distinctions among yourselves, and become judges with evil thoughts? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hearken, my beloved brethren; did not God choose them that are poor as to the world ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " rich in faith, and heirs of the kingdom which he promised to them that love him? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But ye have dishonored the poor man. Do not the rich oppress you, and themselves drag you before the judgment-seats? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not they blaspheme the honorable name by which ye are called? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Howbeit if ye fulfil the royal law, according to the scripture, Thou shalt love thy neighbor as thyself, ye do well: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but if ye have respect of persons, ye commit sin, being convicted by the law as transgressors. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For whosoever shall keep the whole law, and yet stumble in one ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", he is become guilty of all. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he that said, Do not commit adultery, said also, Do not kill. Now if thou dost not commit adultery, but killest, thou art become a transgressor of the law. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So speak ye, and so do, as men that are to be judged by a law of liberty. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For judgment ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " without mercy to him that hath showed no mercy: mercy glorieth against judgment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What doth it profit, my brethren, if a man say he hath faith, but have not works? can that faith save him? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If a brother or sister be naked and in lack of daily food, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and one of you say unto them, Go in peace, be ye warmed and filled; and yet ye give them not the things needful to the body; what doth it profit? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even so faith, if it have not works, is dead in itself. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, a man will say, Thou hast faith, and I have works: show me thy faith apart from ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " works, and I by my works will show thee ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " faith. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou believest that God is one; thou doest well: the demons also believe, and shudder. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But wilt thou know, O vain man, that faith apart from works is barren? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Was not Abraham our father justified by works, in that he offered up Isaac his son upon the altar? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou seest that faith wrought with his works, and by works was faith made perfect; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the scripture was fulfilled which saith, And Abraham believed God, and it was reckoned unto him for righteousness; and he was called the friend of God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye see that by works a man is justified, and not only by faith. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And in like manner was not also Rahab the harlot justified by works, in that she received the messengers, and sent them out another way? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For as the body apart from the spirit is dead, even so faith apart from works is dead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "JAS.3",
    "number": "3",
    "bookId": "JAS"
  },
